{
  "about": "Abilities: what a creature can choose to do. Orsino skills and spells are generated into data/catalog/orsino/abilities.json; this file holds Kyr's own abilities and adaptations. kind is technique, spell (with tradition, level and school or domain; a spell spends one slot) or natural. effect is written in the Kyr effect language; effects is the typed form.",
  "abilities": {
    "flee": {
      "name": "Flee",
      "kind": "technique",
      "effect": "Flee.",
      "source": {
        "orsino": "ability:flee",
        "fidelity": "adapted",
        "notes": "Orsino offers player-side combatants Flee every turn: an even chance (Math.random() < 0.5; Kyr rolls from the seeded stream) to end the fight. Orsino's monster Escape skill rolls a will save that, as written for fear effects, makes a successful save fail; Kyr uses the player rule for every creature that flees."
      }
    },
    "fire_ward": {
      "name": "Fire ward",
